.TH TIMECLOCK 1
.SH NAME
timeclock \- punch clock
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/timeclock
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I TimeClock
is a punch clock.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Punch in and out from Tk buttons and view a text report of the log.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Punch In / Punch Out / Report buttons
Timekeeping
.TP
.B entry + Enter
Punch in with note
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH FILES
.TP
.B /tmp/temple-timeclock.txt
Data file.
.TP
.B ~/temple-timeclock.txt
Documented; code uses /tmp.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/timeclock.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
